# --- Safety Guardrails (Deny List) ---
NEVER run the following without explicit confirmation:
- rm -rf, DROP TABLE, git push --force, npm publish, bun publish

ALWAYS ask for permission before:
- Database migrations, deployment commands, or modifying .env files.

# --- Code SEO & Brevity ---
- Use complete domain names (e.g., OrderProcessor not OrdSvc).
- Before adding new code, search for existing similar patterns to avoid duplication.
- Split large files into smaller, focused modules.
